#: pages/templates/pages/base.html:41
#, python-format
msgid "A demo shop for %(model_rag)s and %(minimal_rag)s."
msgstr "Une boutique de démonstration pour %(model_rag)s et %(minimal_rag)s."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:4
msgid "Welcome to the Fromagerie du Marché"
msgstr "Bienvenue à la Fromagerie du Marché"

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:5
msgid ""
"A small, fictional French cheese shop: its cheeses, its pages and its blog "
"posts are plain Django models. django-model-rag turns them into documents, "
"and django-minimal-rag indexes them so that questions about the shop can be "
"answered from its own content."
msgstr ""
"Une petite fromagerie française, fictive : ses fromages, ses pages et les "
"articles de son blog sont de simples modèles Django. django-model-rag les "
"transforme en documents, et django-minimal-rag les indexe pour que les "
"questions sur la boutique trouvent leur réponse dans son propre contenu."

#: pages/templates/pages/home.html:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Browse the <a href=\"%(products_url)s\">cheeses</a> or read the <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s\">articles</a>."
msgstr ""
"Parcourez les <a href=\"%(products_url)s\">fromages</a> ou lisez les <a "
"href=\"%(articles_url)s\">articles</a>."

